`).join('\n') }}

**QUESTIONS & ANSWERS:**
{{ $('QUERY KNOWLEDGE BASE').item.json.output.answers.map((qa, i) => `
Q${i + 1}: ${qa.question}
A${i + 1}: ${qa.answer}
`).join('\n') }}

**GENERAL INFO:**
{{ $('QUERY KNOWLEDGE BASE').item.json.output.general_info }}

**YOUR TASK:**
Write a professional quotation email using ALL the information above. Include vessel details, contact info, services with rates, answers to questions, and general information.

